==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Secret Crush Base (Enemy Base)|Secret Crush Base]].
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because the enemies in the stage are extremely fragile and don't even attack, any lineup from the [[Heartbeat Catcademy#List of Stages|previous stages]] can beat it.

